@startuml
title Create Immutable Data Record - Sequence Diagram

actor Developer
participant Database

Developer -> Database: Request to create record (data, schema ID)

activate Database
Database -> Database: Validate data against schema
alt Data Valid
  Database -> Database: Generate unique record ID
  Database -> Database: Create immutable record
  Database -> Database: Store record
  Database -> Developer: Return record ID
else Data Invalid
  Database -> Developer: Return error message
end
deactivate Database

@enduml